91
00:05:16,615 --> 00:05:18,895
Kailangan nating panatilihing bukas ang bawat posibilidad.

92
00:05:18,895 --> 00:05:23,507
Kasarian, edad, nasyonalidad, at iba pa.

93
00:05:23,507 --> 00:05:25,599
Si Kingfisher ay...

94
00:05:25,599 --> 00:05:27,692
